      "required_correction": "Before applying or admitting a successor, either retain separately callable v0.13.1 evidence validation or provide a checked historical-context bridge that replays every stored old source/contract/source-input binding without passing the row through the current v0.14.0 pin. A stored row must never be relabeled as v0.14.0 merely because the checkout now has v0.14.0 pins.",
