      "required_correction": "Replace this single ambiguous field with an exact historical Bifrost context list, or correct it to bind all old Bifrost source commits/contracts/source-input closures. Do not treat the Joern commit as the Bifrost historical source and do not silently infer equivalence.",
      "severity": "blocker-before-application-or-admission",
